# 'body []E_NSURE 'cleanup runs the cleanup (a lambda of @) after the
# body, whether the body gave a value or stopped with an error, and
# gives the body's value (the error case is ensure-error).
== SOURCE
'{ @ -> p_rint! 1; 2 } []E_NSURE '{ @ -> p_rint! "cleaned" }
== TYPE
Int
== RESULT
1
cleaned
2
